OL,3,GNEWSAScottish government urges Glasgow
OL,4,ACity Council to pause fire and rehire
OL,5,Aplans
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's deputy first minister has
OL,8,Fcalled on Glasgow City Council to pause
OL,9,Fits plans to fire and rehire workers.
OL,11,FJenny Gilruth said the Scottish
OL,12,Fgovernment did not support fire and
OL,13,Frehire schemes and urged the council
OL,14,Fand trade unions to get back around the
OL,15,Fnegotiating table.
OL,17,FThe council threatened to sack more
OL,18,Fthan 23,000 members of staff and then
OL,19,Frehire them on new contracts after
OL,20,Fnegotiations with unions over equal pay
OL,21,Fproposals broke down.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
