OL,3,GNEWSAScottish government urges Glasgow
OL,4,ACity Council to pause fire and rehire
OL,5,Aplans
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe talks were about the council's
OL,8,Fplans to replace a pay system found to
OL,9,Fdiscriminate against mostly women
OL,10,Fworkers. The changes would see the
OL,11,Fmajority of staff unaffected or better
OL,12,Foff, but they would cut pay for 11% of
OL,13,Fstaff.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
